Welcome to Isotope Server, the headless edition of Isotope, built from source on Kairos.

  Network    : nmcli device status   ·   sudo nmcli connection modify …
  Updates    : isotope   ·   isotope upgrade
  Extensions : isotope ext list   ·   isotope ext browse
  Backups    : isotope backup init <dir>   ·   isotope backup
  Containers : docker ps   ·   docker run --rm hello-world
